<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 21-MAR.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 21-MAR.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Justin is nearing the coast of Queensland. It is expected to approach Cairns in about 24 hours and then move along the coast towards Townsville during the weekend. This system brings rain and wind to the coastal areas during this period. Damage along the coast due to rough seas and moderate to strong winds can be expected. Rain will cause flooding and possible mudslides further inland.</p>
</text>
